  "summary": "ION adds a 2x stacked four-directional IRNN on top of conv5 to produce context features, and pools each ROI's descriptor from conv3, conv4, conv5 and those context features; descriptors are L2-normalized, concatenated, rescaled and reduced by a 1x1 convolution before the Fast R-CNN classification and box heads.",
