  "summary": "YOLOv2 upgrades YOLO with batch normalization, a high-resolution classifier, convolutional anchor boxes with k-means-derived priors, direct location prediction, a passthrough layer, multi-scale training and a new Darknet-19 backbone; YOLO9000 then jointly trains detection and classification over a WordTree hierarchy of 9000+ classes.",
