  "summary": "Cascade R-CNN is a multi-stage extension of R-CNN with a sequence of detectors trained at increasing IoU thresholds, where each stage resamples the progressively improved hypotheses of the previous stage so positive counts stay balanced, and the same cascade is applied at inference.",
