  "summary": "MobileNetV2 introduces the inverted residual with linear bottleneck: a thin bottleneck is expanded, filtered with a lightweight depthwise convolution, and linearly projected back down, with skip connections between the thin bottlenecks and no non-linearity in the narrow layers. The design is instantiated as a mobile backbone and paired with SSDLite for detection and a reduced DeepLabv3 for segmentation.",
