  "summary": "YOLOv4 fixes the architecture as CSPDarknet53 backbone + SPP + PANet neck + anchor-based YOLOv3 head, then systematically selects bag-of-freebies and bag-of-specials ingredients (Mosaic 4-image augmentation, SAT, CmBN, Mish, CIoU loss, DropBlock, genetic-algorithm hyper-parameters, modified SAM and PAN) for single-GPU training.",
