  "summary": "LW-DETR is a light-weight detection transformer built as a plain ViT encoder, a C2f projector and a shallow 3-layer DETR decoder, made fast with interleaved window/global attention in a window-major layout and made accurate with multi-level feature aggregation, IoU-aware loss, Group DETR supervision and Objects365 pretraining.",
