  "problemSummary": "RT-DETRv2 targets three weaknesses of RT-DETR: deformable attention forces the same sampling-point budget on every feature scale, the RT-DETR-specific grid_sample operator constrains deployment, and all scaled detector variants share optimizer hyperparameters that fit them sub-optimally.",
